---

<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="container footer-inner">
    <div class="footer-main">
      <span class="footer-logo">🏘️ Tiny Tool Town</span>
      <p class="footer-tagline">Free, fun & open source tiny tools.<br>Stupid-delightful software made with love.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer-links">
      <a href="/tools/">Browse Tools</a>
      <a href="/submit/">Submit a Tool</a>
      <a href="/about/">About</a>
      <a href="https://github.com/shanselman/TinyToolTown" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a>
      <a href="/rss.xml" title="RSS feed">RSS</a>
    </div>
    <div class="footer-feeds">
      <span class="footer-feeds-label">Platform feeds:</span>
      <a href="/rss/windows.xml">Windows</a>
      <a href="/rss/macos.xml">macOS</a>
      <a href="/rss/linux.xml">Linux</a>
      <a href="/rss/ios.xml">iOS</a>
      <a href="/rss/android.xml">Android</a>
      <a href="/rss/web.xml">Web</a>
    </div>
    <div class="footer-bottom">
      <p>Made with ✨ vibes ✨ — <a href="https://hanselman.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Scott Hanselman</a></p>
      <p class="footer-geo">Vibe coding is the GeoCities of the AI era</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .site-footer {
    margin-top: 4rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    padding: 3rem 0 2rem;
    background: rgba(15, 14, 23, 0.5);
  }

  .footer-inner {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .footer-logo {
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
  }

  .footer-tagline {
    color: var(--color-text);
    opacity: 0.7;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    margin-top: 0.25rem;
  }

  .footer-links {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .footer-links a {
    color: var(--color-text);
    opacity: 0.7;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    transition: color 0.2s, opacity 0.2s;
  }

  .footer-links a:hover {
    color: var(--color-primary);
    opacity: 1;
  }

  .footer-feeds {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  .footer-feeds-label {
    color: var(--color-text);
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  .footer-feeds a {
    color: var(--color-text);
    opacity: 0.85;
    transition: color 0.2s, opacity 0.2s;
  }

  .footer-feeds a:hover {
    color: var(--color-primary);
    opacity: 1;
  }

  .footer-bottom {
    color: var(--color-text);
    opacity: 0.6;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }

  .footer-geo {
    font-style: italic;
    opacity: 0.6;
    margin-top: 0.25rem;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
  }
</style>
